====== TP-Link TL-MR22U v1 ======

/* This template is intended to be used via https://openwrt.org/meta/create_new_device_page . */

TP-Link TL-MR22U is a 5200mAh battery powered 3G router with dual-chain 2.4GHz wifi and more processing power than previous hornet-based TP-Link mobile 3G router series. Default device firmware: 3.17.1 Build 140123 Rel.31844n has been made for chinese market, firmware translated to english is available: [[https://github.com/psyborg55/tp-link/blob/master/TL-MR22U_V1.0_20140123_EN.rar|TL-MR22U_V1.0_20140123_EN.rar]] Installing OpenWrt is quite tricky due to signed-firmware and less than required RAM, but is possible.

{{ media:tplink:tl-mr22u_case.jpg?300|TL-MR22U v1}}

